# Test: OSPFv3 neighbor + interface deep dump.
#
# VALIDATES: spec-ospf-ext-14 -- `show ospf ipv6 neighbor detail` / `... interface detail` surface link-local identity, Interface ID, Instance ID, and the R/V6/E/N/AF option bits (AC-11).
# PREVENTS: a regression in the OSPF debug/introspection surface.
#
# Live FRR/QEMU multicast convergence is owned by the ospf-debug-*-frr interop scenarios.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=go test -v ./internal/plugins/ospf ./internal/plugins/ospf/iface -run TestNeighborDetailOptionBits|TestInterfaceDetailSnapshot|TestV3NewCommandsPipeComplete -count=1:timeout=60s
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=TestInterfaceDetailSnapshot
expect=stdout:contains=TestV3NewCommandsPipeComplete
expect=stdout:contains=PASS
